        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR is part of a series in which I update the Learn area \"Challenge\" articles. In general, they need to be modernized, restructured, and put in better positions in the modules so they are spaced out better and test subjects that have already been covered.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR specifically adds a new challenge that tests selectors, the box model, and specificity/conflicts.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40987",
            "title": "Add new selectors, box model, and conflicts challenge",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-02T14:44:01.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-02T14:41:58.000Z",
            "author": {
