            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Document the <code class=\"notranslate\">IdentityCredentialError</code> interface (aka \"FedCM Error API\").</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Complete the Authentication reference docs.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Specification: <a href=\"https://w3c-fedid.github.io/FedCM/#browser-api-identity-credential-error-interface\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c-fedid.github.io/FedCM/#browser-api-identity-credential-error-interface</a><br>\nSome (outdated) docs are here: <a href=\"https://privacysandbox.google.com/blog/fedcm-chrome-120-updates#error-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://privacysandbox.google.com/blog/fedcm-chrome-120-updates#error-api</a><br>\nAn (outdated) explainer is here: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1801653737\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c-fedid/FedCM/issues/488\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c-fedid/FedCM/issues/488/hovercard?comment_id=1679742999&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c-fedid/FedCM/issues/488#issuecomment-1679742999\">w3c-fedid/FedCM#488 (comment)</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome is probably not implementing according to the spec. I've asked about this in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3375883038\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c-fedid/FedCM/issues/780\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c-fedid/FedCM/issues/780/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c-fedid/FedCM/issues/780\">w3c-fedid/FedCM#780</a></p>",
