        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'm updating the screenshot &amp; docs for Sauce Labs so it has up-to-date info.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The screenshot shows an older UI.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ideally, we don't have screenshots of external products at all due to how quickly they go stale, but I went through the registration steps here so this older issue is fixed as it's probably worth refreshing.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Issues and PRs</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #28034.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1810372274\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/28034\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/28034/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/28034\">#28034</a></p>",
