        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We have another case where we're describing specificity, <code class=\"notranslate\">@scope</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp;</code>. Removing the duplication and pointing to browser compat (depends on <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3371832100\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27723\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27723/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27723\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27723</a>).</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We have conflicting info, specs are updated and it looks like Fx142 is the only browser to make default behavior spec-compliant.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249101586\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40481\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40481/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40481\">#40481</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40981.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3375534478\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40981\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40981/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40981\">#40981</a></p>",
