            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Migrates the <code class=\"notranslate\">yarn start</code> command to the new MDN front end (fred).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See also: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/\">https://github.com/mdn/fred/</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The existing command is preserved with a <code class=\"notranslate\">:legacy</code> suffix for now.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Consistency with the deployed MDN site.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note: The PR Review Companion will be migrated in a separate PR.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3366685269\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/667\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/fred/issues/667/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/667\">mdn/fred#667</a></li>\n</ul>",
