        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 139 adds support for 3D textures using BC and ASTC compressed formats. See <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5080855386783744\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5080855386783744</a>, and also see <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-webgpu-139#3d_texture_support_for_bc_and_astc_compressed_formats\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-webgpu-139#3d_texture_support_for_bc_and_astc_compressed_formats</a> for a bit more explanation.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR updates related information on the <code class=\"notranslate\">GPUSupportedFeatures</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">createTexture()</code> pages.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
